WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:05.980
Muslims call it al-Qadr: God's decree,
the measuring out of all things.

2
00:00:06.030 --> 00:00:09.600
The Qur'an says that all
things are created in measure.

3
00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:13.330
It also says: let him who will, believe.

4
00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:17.350
Muslims believe God knows and
has recorded all that happens.

5
00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:21.020
They also believe God will judge
each person by their deeds.

6
00:00:21.070 --> 00:00:23.610
So if God has already decreed everything,

7
00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:26.140
how can judging your choices be fair?

8
00:00:26.190 --> 00:00:31.300
In this mission, you'll see why Muslims say
these two beliefs must be held together.

9
00:00:31.350 --> 00:00:34.760
Then you'll explore what the
belief means for everyday life,

10
00:00:34.810 --> 00:00:37.060
in success and in failure.

11
00:00:37.110 --> 00:00:42.190
Your mission: find out how Muslims hold
God's decree and human responsibility

12
00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:42.920
together.
